11
00:00:14,854 --> 00:00:15,859
Spot the difference.

12
00:00:15,879 --> 00:00:17,116
There isn't one.

13
00:00:17,136 --> 00:00:18,697
Biology should
change the build.

14
00:00:18,717 --> 00:00:19,984
Four traits are easy.

15
00:00:20,004 --> 00:00:21,571
The fifth is the
twist.

16
00:00:21,591 --> 00:00:22,696
One:
senses.

17
00:00:22,716 --> 00:00:24,134
They see in the dark,
so they live

18
00:00:24,154 --> 00:00:25,047
underground.

19
00:00:25,067 --> 00:00:26,283
Two:
lifespan.

20
00:00:26,303 --> 00:00:27,820
Four hundred years,
so they build in

21
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:28,524
stone.

22
00:00:28,544 --> 00:00:29,520
Three:
family.

23
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:31,112
One clan,
one great hall.

24
00:00:31,132 --> 00:00:32,137
Four:
needs.

25
00:00:32,157 --> 00:00:33,362
Their skin must stay
wet,

26
00:00:33,382 --> 00:00:34,781
so they build on the
lake.

27
00:00:34,801 --> 00:00:35,581
Run it again.

28
00:00:35,601 --> 00:00:37,408
Nothing here looks
human now.

29
00:00:37,428 --> 00:00:38,033
Rule five?

30
00:00:38,053 --> 00:00:38,858
How they talk.

31
00:00:38,878 --> 00:00:40,330
The Fenn speak in
light.

32
00:00:40,350 --> 00:00:41,630
So their hall has no
walls,

33
00:00:41,650 --> 00:00:42,830
