34
00:00:42,850 --> 00:00:44,135
And from the human
valley?

35
00:00:44,155 --> 00:00:45,784
Ghost lights on the
lake.

36
00:00:45,804 --> 00:00:47,487
Pointy ears are a
costume.

37
00:00:47,507 --> 00:00:49,231
Biology is a
blueprint.

38
00:00:49,251 --> 00:00:50,991
Invent one
biological trait

39
00:00:51,011 --> 00:00:52,178
that would
completely change a

40
00:00:52,198 --> 00:00:53,641
